    },
    {
      "displayText": "請看我為了自己的夢想而\n收集的冰寶們！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 240,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8ACB770B621170BA4E8681EA5DF17684592260F3800C000A653696C6768451B05BF65011FF01001000020114018B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我的夢想，那就是！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 288,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62117684592260F3FF0C90A35C31662FFF01001000020114018B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "冰岩怪背背冰寶！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 316,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "51B05CA9602A80CC80CC51B05BF6FF01001000020114018B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "沒錯！我想看看冰寶\n被超大的冰岩怪背在背上的樣子。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 344,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6C92932FFF01621160F3770B770B51B05BF6000A88AB8D855927768451B05CA9602A80CC572880CC4E0A76846A235B503002001000020114018B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "冰哆哆！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 404,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "51B054C654C6FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "所以，請讓我發自內心超級認真地\n拜託<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳這位看起來很厲害的訓練家。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 416,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62404EE5FF0C8ACB8B936211767C81EA51675FC38D857D1A8A8D771F5730000A62DC8A1700100003110000FF01014F6059B390194F4D770B8D774F865F8853B25BB376848A137DF45BB63002001000020114018B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "請讓我看看能背4隻冰寶的\n超大冰岩怪！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n我想想喔，\n用尺寸來說的話就是XL尺寸！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 504,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8ACB8B936211770B770B80FD80CC003496BB51B05BF67684000A8D85592751B05CA9602AFF0100100001BE01000A621160F360F35594FF0C000A75285C3A5BF84F868AAA76848A715C31662F0058004C5C3A5BF8FF01001000020114018B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
